### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Test Confluence Connection
GET {{baseUrl}}/test_connection
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### List All Spaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/spaces
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Search Content (Global)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?query=test&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Search Content in Specific Space
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?query=documentation&space_key=TEST&limit=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Simple Search in Space
GET {{baseUrl}}/search_simple?space_key=TEST&query=page&limit=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Create a New Page
POST {{baseUrl}}/create_page
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "space_key": "TEST",
  "title": "API Test Page {{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "body": "<h1>Test Page from VS Code</h1><p>This page was created using the REST Client extension in VS Code.</p><h2>Features</h2><ul><li>Easy API testing</li><li>Environment variables</li><li>Request history</li></ul><p><strong>Created:</strong> {{$datetime iso8601}}</p>"
}

### Create a Simple Page
POST {{baseUrl}}/create_page_simple
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "space_key": "TEST",
  "title": "Simple Test Page {{$timestamp}}",
  "body": "<h1>Simple Test</h1><p>This is a simple test page created with the simplified endpoint.</p>"
}

### Get Page by ID (replace with actual page ID from create response)
@pageId = 123456
GET {{baseUrl}}/page/{{pageId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Update Page (replace with actual page ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/page/{{pageId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Updated Test Page",
  "body": "<h1>Updated Content</h1><p>This page has been updated via the REST API.</p><p><strong>Updated:</strong> {{$datetime iso8601}}</p>"
}

### Update Page Body Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/page/{{pageId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "<h1>New Body Content</h1><p>Only the body content has been updated.</p><p><em>Title remains the same.</em></p>"
}

### Update Page Title Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/page/{{pageId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "New Page Title {{$timestamp}}"
}
